OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry and bright
OL,6,Fstart but cloud will soon thicken with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain spreading northeast
OL,8,Ffrom late morning onwards. Rain will
OL,9,Fturn heavy and persistent in the
OL,10,Fafternoon accompanied by strong
OL,11,Fsoutheasterly winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain quickly clears away
OL,14,Fnortheast, then drier for a time in
OL,15,Fthe evening before further outbreaks
OL,16,Fof heavy rain arrive. Windy everywhere
OL,17,Fwith southerly gales along the east
OL,18,FAberdeenshire coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
