OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FRather cloudy with further
OL,6,Fshowers, some heavy, but drier and
OL,7,Fbrighter across northeast
OL,8,FAberdeenshire. A very windy day with
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly gales.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells and scattered showers on
OL,13,FWednesday then mainly dry and bright
OL,14,Fon Thursday and Friday. Feeling mild,
OL,15,Fbut breezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
